/01JJ38W6V41HPE5677PT10EHHM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n そして1部の途中からは恐竜🦖のカチューシャをつけました😆\n 皆さんがチラチラと恐竜を見ている姿をみて、ニヤ〜😏っと心の中で思っていました！笑\n \n \n \n \n \n 2部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38W7Z79VN2FR2HTDF20Q3P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n もうワンパターンのスヌーピーのかぶり物♡\n 髪の毛おろしはやっぱりまだ緊張するなぁ〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38W96CBZSMB5YRYKP8BQ1D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ポンポンがついてます！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38WAEG0T28T03TSP7R0XW1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n このちゃん😳"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38WBGH8T13QF81HP6RDGWF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n わちゃちゃ！！\n \n \n \n この日の握手会の前半はユニバーサルスタジオジャパンの気分🤩というテーマの握手会でした！\n \n \n 次のブログに続きます(^^)\n \n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #318"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18476":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちぃちゃん みなみ2人とも大好き♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメント！\n正直読むの怖かったけど\n読ませていただきました......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに皆あたたかくて...涙が溢れだしちゃっいました......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも素敵な皆さんと出会えた事に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の前では、いつも笑顔でいたいのに\n弱音も言っていいよって言ってくれる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろうって言ってくれる..."},{"type":"bre